            "review_title": "Review at Ot Hiem",
            "review_text": "Maps528429\nCaversham, United Kingdom54 contributions\n0\nA lovely Vietnamese restaurant\nDec 2024 • Family\nWe thought this was a wonderful gem. Lovely decor and friendly staff. One of the waiters spoke better English and helped us decide on our food order. The food was delicious and the portions generous. We ordered prawns and rice and the rice in that was enough to share with others. We also had the bbq pork ribs, grilled and fried calamari, steak and some few veg dishes. Prices very reasonable and a great night!\nRead more\nWritten December 26, 2024",
            "rating": 3.0,
