            "review_text": "JohnTSJC\nSan Jose, California366 contributions\n0\nGreat Local Restaurant in Nha Trang\nMar 2023 • Friends\nA group of ten of us went to this restaurant for lunch. It was less than a 10-minute walk from our hotel. WOW, we were surprised with the decor, service, and quality of the food. They had some real local Southern style dishes- you dont find just anywhere. For example, we had the Bitter Melon and Fishball Soup that was out of this world! Their Grilled chicken was also very tasty.\nPrices are considered high for local standards, but our group felt that it was very reasonable.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten April 27, 2023",
